    "# Practice Tasks"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cb6fe23c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Basic Imports"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "1ace88e5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "url = \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/datasciencedojo/datasets/master/titanic.csv\"\n",
    "df = pd.read_csv(url)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "79164255",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Task 1 — GroupBy basics"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "97ec85b4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Find the average fare paid by passengers in each embarkation port. Sort the result from highest to lowest."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "a873ca08",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "Embarked\n",
       "C    59.954144\n",
       "S    27.079812\n",
       "Q    13.276030\n",
       "Name: Fare, dtype: float64"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 4,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "df.groupby(\"Embarked\")[\"Fare\"].mean().sort_values(ascending=False)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1764bafc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Task 2 — .agg()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7010482c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Group by Sex and calculate in one .agg() call: average age, average fare, total number of passengers, and survival rate. Name your columns clearly."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "4e4cae59",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/html": [
       "<div>\n",
       "<style scoped>\n",
       "    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n",
       "        vertical-align: middle;\n",
       "    }\n",
       "\n",
       "    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n",
       "        vertical-align: top;\n",
